title: "Arfania_coder: Data and R code for the CAF LTAR tile-drainage delta18O-PO4 study"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible data and R code accompanying Arfania et al. (in review),
  "Tillage x Flow Regime Interaction Controls Phosphorus Source Dynamics in
  Tile Drainage: Integrating Continuous Discharge Monitoring, Water Residence
  Time, and Phosphate Oxygen Isotopes," submitted to JGR Biogeosciences.
